{"asset_key":"ep6/gameplay_story_16602040","episode":"ep6","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"16602040","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1660204001:0":{"text":"女神在上，多亏了几位的帮助！","source_cn":"女神在上，多亏了几位的帮助！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x728C3FFF861B8A8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1660204002:1":{"text":"剧团里怎么会有魔物？虽然不怎么强就是了。","source_cn":"剧团里怎么会有魔物？虽然不怎么强就是了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FBC582FE948CD8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1660204003:1":{"text":"太危险了，剧团里的人还好吗，有没有人受伤？","source_cn":"太危险了，剧团里的人还好吗，有没有人受伤？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6C4C01D694C42C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1660204004:1":{"text":"没有人受伤，但是今天的排演应该没办法继续了。","source_cn":"没有人受伤，但是今天的排演应该没办法继续了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88205FA7CC372EF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1660204005:0":{"text":"我有种奇怪的感觉……有什么特殊的事情发生吗？","source_cn":"我有种奇怪的感觉……有什么特殊的事情发生吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CC97756D15DC307","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1